Implemented US-008.

Added a SQLite-backed workspace index in [`packages/codegen/src/sqlite-workspace-index.ts`](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/sqlite-workspace-index.ts) and wired it through [`packages/codegen/src/workspace-index.ts`](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/workspace-index.ts) and [`packages/codegen/src/index.ts`](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/index.ts). It creates `.oa-cache/state.sqlite` by default with the required tables, enables WAL/busy timeout/foreign keys, wraps writes in transactions, stores schema/options compatibility metadata, supports cache clear, and falls back to full rebuild behavior on SQLite errors.

